[00:15.11]Feel that fall apart till I walk on my ankles
{"感觉自己在崩溃边缘　直到用脚踝行走"}
[00:21.46]Can I finish? I just don't know
{"我能完成吗？我真的不知道"}
[00:27.77]People travel millions of miles just to see it
{"人们跋涉千万里　只为亲眼目睹"}
[00:34.18]But they never conquer this way
{"但他们从未以这种方式征服"}
[01:19.13]I can tell them the greatest gains have conditions
{"我可以告诉他们最大的收获有条件"}
[01:25.02]But they're too far to hear what I say
{"但他们离得太远　听不见我说的话"}
